CM_ BO_ 1020 "Every bit is defined so the openpilot relay repacks the camera frame byte for byte; undefined bits were dropped and the relayed CRC went stale.";
CM_ SG_ 1020 NEW_SIGNAL_4 "2 whenever the model sees both lane lines, ACC on or off; likely lane lines detected.";
CM_ SG_ 1020 NEW_SIGNAL_6 "1 or 2; 2 mostly with ACC active above ~60 kph. Meaning unconfirmed.";
CM_ SG_ 1020 NEW_SIGNAL_7 "1 or 2; 2 mostly with ACC active above ~60 kph. Reads 3 while the camera's own lane keeping steers (route 00000494 seg 15, 2 of 2 interventions) and 1 for ~2.7 s after one; likely the yellow HUD lane-line warning. Not confirmed on the cluster.";
CM_ SG_ 483 EPS_INACTIVE "1 only while lateral is off, and EPS_TORQUE then reads 1023 (raw 0x7FF). Bits 3-7 of byte 0 read a constant 10 (route 0000049e segs 30-31, 12k frames).";
CM_ SG_ 483 EPS_DIR_RIGHT "Set while EPS_TORQUE > ~+78, clear inside the deadband. Wheel turning right while set (mean rate -2.3 deg/s, route 00000494 seg 20).";
CM_ SG_ 483 EPS_DIR_LEFT "Set while EPS_TORQUE < ~-80, clear inside the deadband. Wheel turning left while set (mean rate +6.4 deg/s, route 00000494 seg 20).";
CM_ SG_ 483 EPS_TORQUE "Likely EPS motor output, sign opposite to openpilot (negative = left). corr -0.46 to the 0x345 angle command and to steering rate, -0.49 to angle error lagged 80 ms (route 0000049e segs 30-31); corr -0.63 to steering rate on route 00000494 seg 20. Unit unknown.";
CM_ SG_ 775 NEW_SIGNAL_2 "Reads 3 while the camera's own lane keeping steers, 1 otherwise: tracks LKAS_CAM_CMD_345.LKA_ACTIVE within 30 ms (corr 0.95, route 00000494 seg 15).";
CM_ SG_ 837 NEW_SIGNAL_2 "Undefined bit the camera sets on some frames (49 of 3000, route 00000494 seg 15); defined so the stock steering relay is byte exact.";
CM_ SG_ 1020 NEW_SIGNAL_3 "Centred on 0 (raw 256). With both lane lines seen: corr +0.52 to lane offset, -0.40 to curvature.";
CM_ SG_ 1020 NEW_SIGNAL_12 "3 on every frame of route 00000488.";
CM_ SG_ 1020 NEW_SIGNAL_14 "3 on every frame of route 00000488.";
CM_ BO_ 1005 "Front ADAS camera lead estimate (the car has no radar). Two 3-byte object slots; 07 FA EA marks an empty slot. No relative speed.";
CM_ SG_ 1005 LEAD_DISTANCE "Fit against the openpilot model lead on 21 stock-ACC segments: corr 0.96, model x = 0.95 * LEAD_DISTANCE + 2.7.";
CM_ SG_ 1005 LEAD_CLASS "Matched on video: 1 car, 2 truck, 3 motorcycle. 4 and 5 seen rarely, unidentified.";
CM_ SG_ 1005 LEAD_LATERAL "Positive left. Scale fit loosely (corr 0.73 against the model lead).";
CM_ BO_ 1018 "Adjacent-lane objects from the front camera, same slot layout as LEAD_FRONT. On 21 segments the first slot sat left in 98% of frames (median +2.6 m), the second right in 97% (median -3.1 m).";
CM_ SG_ 1005 LEAD_DISTANCE_2 "Same layout as the first slot; seen holding an 18 m car while a motorcycle took the first slot.";
VAL_ 62 GEAR 1 "P" 2 "R" 3 "N" 4 "D";
